# IMPORTANT: package-lock.json is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It pins exact dependency versions across every machine/deploy that
# installs this app - without it, "works on my machine" bugs and
# version-drift vulnerabilities become possible. Always commit it
# alongside any package.json change. See ../backend/SECURITY-MAINTENANCE.md.
